 <h3><span></span> Core Architecture &amp; Mental Model</h3>
 <div class="analogy-callout">
 <strong>Real-World Analogy:</strong> A Typed State Store is a digital broadcasting tower: it holds a vault of verified data (`&lt;T&gt;`), and whenever the vault changes, it broadcasts the new state to all subscribed radio listeners with 100% type safety.
 </div>
